    }
  ],
  "patternRefs": [
    "DPK-PAT-3137"
  ],
  "remediation": "Point the declaration or the registry configuration at the namespace the project controls, and remove the lookup path that resolves elsewhere. Specifically: fix a `<repository>` whose id shadows `central`.",
  "limitation": "It matches a `<repository>` whose id shadows `central` in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
}
